<title>USA: Conde Nast names Hunsinger publisher Architectural.</title>
<headline>Conde Nast names Hunsinger publisher Architectural.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conde Nast said on Wednesday that it named Peter Hunsinger publisher of Architectural Digest, effective March 3.</p>
<p>Hunsigner replaces Thomas Losee who is retiring in March. Hunsinger has been the publisher of Gourmet since 1993. The company said it plans to announce Hunsinger's replacement at Gourmet in the near future.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
